WEBVTT

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.960
Are you absolutely certain that
you'll be okay on your own, Shutaro?!

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:14.540
Yes, Grandfather.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.580
I shall lay my life on the line to study hard,

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.040
and make sure I do not bring any dishonor
to the Mendo Family crest.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.540
How splendid! You're so reliable!

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:28.290
Make sure to be a good role model
for everyone at your new school, okay?

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.080
Of course! I'll do my best!

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.580
Young Master.
We have arrived at Tomobiki High School.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:34.830
Great.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.920
Have a nice day, Young Master.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.920
Thanks, you too.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:57.460
I appreciate you seeing me off, Grandfather.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.710
Don't forget to take a handkerchief!

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:01.670
A-and some toilet paper!

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.000
It's time, Young Master.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Right.

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:05.880
Please be careful.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:06.960
Sure.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.920
Here I gooooooo! Bye!

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.130
I can't take this anymore!

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:50.460
The day has barely started

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:52.830
and you're already acting like
this is some kinda flirt fest!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.210
Enough is enough!

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.670
Shinobu! Cool your jets!

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.080
Darling! Don't take her crap!

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.290
I hate your guts!
It's like they're a bunch of 5 year olds...<b></b>

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:00.540
It's like they're a bunch of 5 year olds...

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.790
TAKE THIS! YOU DEGENERATE!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.130
Huh?

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.960
Wh-what the hell is that?

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.290
<b>Trouble Rains Down!!</b>

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.210
What is the meaning of this?!

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.420
Oh hey, teach.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:23.080
Some guy came parachuting out of nowhere
and now he's hugging onto a desk!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.790
That could've ended badly
for someone without my reflexes.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:32.130
Young Master!

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:34.290
Are you all right?!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.670
Shutarooooo!

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:37.960
Everything's okay!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.790
You know it would take far worse
than this to injure me!

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.670
What's the deal with this guy?

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.250
He's making such a racket.

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.830
H-hold on, are you the transfer student
we're expecting today?

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.210
Indeed.

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:52.080
I'm Mendo. Is there a problem?

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.960
THERE OBVIOUSLY IS!
WHAT THE HECK ARE THOSE?!

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:57.290
Those are my family's private helicopters.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.790
Needless to say, it would be
a disgrace to the Mendo name

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.920
if I didn't show up on time for my first day.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.920
FLYING TO SCHOOL IS PROHIBITED!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.170
How interesting...

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:06.830
I never expected a desk to come flying at me.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.580
It seems that peasant culture
is far beyond my understanding.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.960
LISTEN TO ME, DOGGONE IT!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.500
P-pardon me...

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:17.710
I'm so sorry. I was the one who threw the desk.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.670
D-did you really?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:20.920
Yes.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:23.170
I don't believe it.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:25.500
To think someone as beautiful as you...

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.540
Huh?

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.210
Please, don't pay any mind to it.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:30.960
Come now, give me a smile.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:33.080
Aw shucks, Shinobu's so lucky!

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.670
Getting to see your smiling face is
the best apology that I could ask for.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.670
Go on.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.080
Hey, Shinobu.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.040
EARTH TO SHINOBU!

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.250
<b>POW!</b>

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.000
H-hey...

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:47.830
<b>SMOOSH!</b>

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:49.580
Shinobu!

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.380
<b>SMOOSH!</b>

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.540
Shinobu! Shinobuuuu!
Something appears to be squirming behind you.<b></b>

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:51.170
<b>SMOOSH</b>

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:52.540
<b>SMOOSH</b>

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:54.000
Oh, it's nothing!

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:55.040
<b>TWHACK!</b>

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:57.210
<b>CLASS 2-4</b>

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.500
Hey, Mendo!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.380
Is your family the same one that owns
the Mendo Conglomerate?

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:02.960
I wouldn't call it a "conglomerate".

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.920
I mean, our assets only amount
to 5 trillion dollars.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.630
Wow! That much?!

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.460
You have lint on you.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:09.330
Oh my...

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.750
Wish I could be a piece of lint.

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.920
Then I would stay stuck to you forever.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.830
Oh, Mendo!

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:18.920
You two-timer! You two-timer!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.580
Oh please! Shut your face!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.710
Listen, kid!
It's rude to go around biting desks!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.000
Mendo!

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:26.080
Hello.

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:28.500
Nice to see you again,
pretty lady who throws desks.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.710
Please, call me Shinobu.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:33.210
Hey. You pathetic, desk-biting lummox.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:34.380
The name's Ataru, pal!

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:37.500
Shinobu is clearly disturbed by your presence,
so you really need to back off!

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.420
Shaddup!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.710
Shinobu is MY girl!

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.250
Quit saying that when you already have me!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.500
Pardon!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:47.920
Come down, miss! It's dangerous for
schoolgirls to be flying through the air!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.630
You must be kidding.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.500
Listen, I'm not a schoolgirl.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:00.880
Okay, if you're not a schoolgirl, then...

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.710
Who exactly are you?

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.830
Lum! That's my name!

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.920
And I'm married to my darling over here!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.000
This clown?!

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.920
Just look at those unfocused eyes...

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:14.580
And that poor excuse of a nose...

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.210
And the saggy shape of his mouth...

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:19.330
He's a dimwit!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.380
Don't do it!

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.460
Being married a dimwit
will only lead to hardship!

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.290
Mind your own business, jerk!

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:27.000
Shinobu! You should get mad, too!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.540
I'm not getting married to any idiots,
thank you very much!

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.750
Today's agenda for homeroom is

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.710
holding elections for our new class committee.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.380
Anybody interested in becoming president?

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.580
I would like to run as a candidate!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.540
Such a stud!
Seriously? What's with him?<b></b>

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:45.250
Mendo would be perfect!
Seriously? What's with him?<b></b>

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.420
Mendo would be perfect!

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.920
Okay, Mendo. Then let's hear your platform!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.210
Yeah, come on!

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.420
Make a pledge to take everybody
out for lunch or something!

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:55.420
Very well. I'll share my vision with you.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.210
First and foremost!

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.420
Disciplinary measures will be taken
to crack down on any late students!

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:03.420
Order must be maintained from the very start,
or everything that comes after is ruined!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:07.500
Tardiness must not be tolerated.
It is the root of all evil in student life!

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.880
As for what that entails...

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:12.920
I will find an area within the school to establish
a detention center exclusively for our class

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:14.460
where late students will be punished!

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.290
Hey, I never gave you permission
to use my image!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.290
If students wish to leave early,
they will undergo a lie detector test!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.250
And anyone caught lying will have
their tongue removed immediately!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.330
I'm sick.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:23.540
<b>Lie</b>

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:24.750
Furthermore,

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.580
we will launch extensive investigations
to catch anyone playing hooky,

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.330
and all offenders will face retributive justice
at the hands of the Mendo Private Police!

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:31.790
That's my plan.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.170
We will totally eradicate those three offenses,

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.880
and establish a bright future for our class!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.040
Vote for me!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:42.830
<b>Chirp, chirp</b>

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.750
He looks totally insane.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.960
Yeah, "bright future" my ass.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:49.420
Oh. There's one thing I forgot to say.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:53.670
The punishments for these offenses
shall not apply to any of you fine ladies.

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:57.000
Women deserve respect and
must be treated with kindness, after all.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:08:00.290
Our lives are gonna be a living hell
if he gets his way!

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.960
We need to put forward a rival candidate!

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.710
But none of us regular joes
stand a chance against him.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.540
When it comes to our class,

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.750
the only extraordinary guy
that I can think of is...

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.380
Huh? Me?

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.040
But why me?

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:15.920
You're our only hope, Ataru!

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:17.960
His idiocy goes well beyond the norm!

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:20.040
You're the biggest man on campus!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:22.210
Except he's actually far worse than average.

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:24.170
All the boys are throwing
our support behind you!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.920
In any case, he's definitely the most
superhuman guy we've got!

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:28.460
Go kick his ass!

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.000
You guys...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.670
Make it happen, Moroboshi!

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:39.170
You're the only one here who can
put up a fight against Mendo!

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:43.290
If I'm elected as president...

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.710
Yeah?!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.790
then I call dibs on all the girls in class!

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.290
<b>BAWHOMP!</b>

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.130
All right. Who here is voting for Moroboshi?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.040
Here!
I do!<b>
Me! Me! Me!</b>

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.000
And Mendo?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.960
Yes!
We do!<b>
Yay!</b>

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.630
And the numbers say...

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.500
<b>MENDO                            MOROBOSHI</b>

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.500
It's a tie!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.960
<b>SHOCK</b>

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.960
I'm tied with that dimwit?!

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:10.580
<b>DOOM AND GLOOOOM!</b>

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.920
That's ridonkulous!

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.580
Yeesh, even his reactions
are gaudy as all hell.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.080
There's only one thing to do!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.080
We'll settle this with a competition!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.420
The heck?

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:17.330
What's going on?

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.580
We shall compete in a duel

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:21.380
following the traditional method
that's been in the Mendo Family for ages.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:23.710
Oh? And what's that?

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:25.750
<b>CRACK</b>

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.080
The winner shall be whoever
cleanly shoots the apple

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.000
off the head of their opponent
using a cannon!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.210
Got it?!

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.790
HOW THE HELL HAS YOUR FAMILY
SURVIVED FOR SO LONG

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.670
WHILE DOING SUCH ASININE DUELS?!

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.330
He's probably gonna die.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.920
Talk about barbaric...

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:47.580
Young Master, have you made it official
by performing the rite of challenge?

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.290
Oh, I nearly forgot.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:51.670
We must adhere to tradition.
Prepare the glove.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:52.500
Sir.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:56.420
In accordance with the
official rite of challenge,

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:57.920
I shall hit you with this glove!

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:58.920
Zoop.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:00.960
Don't dodge, you fool!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.040
Zoop, I dodge again.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.540
C-curse you!

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.460
Shadow clone! Shadow clone!
Shadow clone! Shadow clone!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:07.460
<b>SHWIP</b>

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:10.040
Dammit, that slippery eel!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:11.750
I've got you now!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:12.630
<b>THWACK!</b>

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:12.830
Yes!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.920
Ah, damn! The substitution jutsu!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.830
That sneaky little...!

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:21.040
You better step it up!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.380
Enough tricks, you coward!

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:25.460
Get back heeeeeeere!

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:27.750
Ataru is seriously something else...

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.830
He's totally godlike when it
comes to running away.

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:34.210
Oh! It's my darling!

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.960
Hm? What's he doing?

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.210
There's nowhere to run now!

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.960
Aw fudge!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:50.500
Yo, Lum!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.460
Mendo just challenged you to a duel!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.960
WHAT?!

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.290
No! I swear it was just an accident!

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:58.830
Nobody challenges me to a duel
and gets out of it!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.130
You cheeky little puuuuuuuuuunk!

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.290
ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP!

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.250
<b>ZAP</b>

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.250
<b>ZAP</b>

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.130
There they are!

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:07.130
Whoa! Mendo's down for the count!

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:09.290
Oh man! Ataru must have won!

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:10.750
What are you talk-

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:11.960
I sure did!

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.330
It's over...

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.210
I lost before I even knew
what was happening.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:23.080
I can't bear the shame of losing
to that dimwit... so I must kill myself!

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.920
Please don't!

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:27.630
We don't want you to die, Mendo!

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.040
It's the price of failure.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.080
Otherwise my family will be
disgraced forever...

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.290
Don't try and stop me!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.630
I won! I won!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:36.290
Take it easy!
You can be vice-president instead!

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.880
I don't need your pity!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.420
Young Master, allow me to lop off your head.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:41.710
Farewell.

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:45.380
Now that I'm class president,
all the girls are gonna be mine for the taking!

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.920
No one in this class has a single braincell...

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.750
You can't die!

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:51.670
Huh?

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:10.630
Lum! That's my name!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.500
ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.500
<b>ZAP</b>

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.500
<b>ZAP</b>

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:17.170
It's like something clicked inside me.
How do I describe this feeling?

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.330
Young Master!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.750
We have arrived at Tomobiki High School.

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:22.880
Good morning!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.000
Mornin'!

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.040
Hey...

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.460
Where's my darling?

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:28.960
Beats me. He was here just a minute ago.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:29.960
Jeez.

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:31.460
Where'd he go?

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.630
Oh crap, it's Mendo!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.170
Hey Lum! Look out!

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:37.080
Miss Lum?!

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:42.290
So eager that you couldn't help
but dive into my arms, huh?

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:43.960
I appreciate the honesty.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:46.830
Outta the way! I'm trying to find my darling!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.920
The lines will get tangled if you wriggle
around too much. And that's not good!

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:50.710
Huh?

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.920
Oh boy...

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:58.170
Hey, Ataru? What exactly did you
call me out here for?

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.670
Shinobu...

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.080
I'm gonna cut straight to the chase.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.330
Do you actually have
the hots for Mendo or what?

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:06.330
I do!

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:08.790
Uh, okay. Are you sure?

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:09.880
Absolutely!

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:12.330
He's nicer than you are.

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:14.170
Not to mention far more handsome!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.920
He also has more money and...

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.790
Shinobu!

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:18.000
Look me in the eyes!

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:21.330
Have you seen anyone with a
more serious expression than this?!

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:23.130
You look pretty goofy.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:25.830
I don't know what kind of
ambitions you have,

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.500
but keeping your expectations low
is proven to lead to a happier life!

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.040
What are you even talking about?

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.000
What the hell is this?!

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.920
Found you, darling!

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.170
Crap, it's Lum!

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:37.460
What happened to Shinobu?!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.290
Hey Shinobu!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.000
Why, pardon me.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.380
Sorry to weigh you down like this.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.920
Th-that's okay... actually...

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:48.130
What is it? Are you in pain somewhere?

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:50.380
No. I feel incredible right now!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:52.000
Shove off, Mendo!

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.960
Shinobu! What do you mean by "incredible"?!

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:57.040
Be still, my heart...

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:01.130
I can't believe I got pinned
underneath Mendo like that!

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:03.080
SHINOBUUUUUU!

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:07.080
<b>REJECTED</b>

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.080
I hope you weren't hurt by the fall.

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.290
Darling?

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:13.880
Just shaddup!

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:16.420
Shinobu and I finally had
a chance to be all alone...

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:19.210
Why did you and Mendo have to
drop out of the sky and ruin it?!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.540
Wait for me! Darling!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.580
I can't seem to get Miss Lum off my mind.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:25.830
Is this love...?

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:31.460
So, one of the goals of this
outdoor learning experience

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.540
is for everyone to establish
camaraderie with your classmates.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.960
I'm giving you some free time right now.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:37.250
Go have fun!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.250
Check this out!

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.420
Jeez. You always stick to me like glue.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:49.750
Marriage is until death do us part, silly!

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:53.170
I was hoping to get away from Lum

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:55.710
and use this opportunity to get
even more intimate with Shinobu.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:59.080
I know exactly how that
head of yours works, darling.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.130
Miss Lum!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.630
There's a limestone cavern
not too far from here.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.920
Would you care to see it?

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.250
Only if my darling comes along!

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:08.750
No way, jose!

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:10.960
Wait, this could work.

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:13.710
A cavern like that would be really dark...

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:15.830
So when a boy and girl go together...

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:17.040
I'm scared!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.290
It's okay, babe.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.630
Hey, Shinobu!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.790
Mendo's going, you say?
Then I am totally in!

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.540
Friggin' unbelievable!

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.000
Just wait until we're in that dark cavern.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.250
I'm gonna seize the opportunity
to sweep Shinobu off her feet!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.130
I'm gonna cling to Mendo
the first chance I get!

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:37.540
I'll cling to darling once we're inside!

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:41.880
I'll find a way to get Miss Lum alone
and then cozy up to her.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:46.960
By the way, people have been talking about
seeing huge shooting stars around here lately!

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.880
Doesn't that sound romantic?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:49.880
Wow!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:51.250
That's news to me.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:52.460
Exciting stuff!

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:52.790
Hope we see one!

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.500
Something about this just doesn't jive right...
Hope we see one!<b></b>

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:54.920
Something about this just doesn't jive right...
Me too!<b></b>

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:55.750
Me too!

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.960
It seems quite expansive.

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.170
How amazing!

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.080
We should go ALL the way in!

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:06.790
Yes, I think that would be best.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.000
<b>Amazed in a Maze</b>

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.580
Do me a solid, Mendo.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.630
What?

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.080
Let's split the group.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:18.750
I'm going this way.

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:20.500
Hm. All right.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.000
The trail up ahead is split in two!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.920
You're right! There are two paths!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.830
Oh no! The flashlight died!

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.330
Aw shucks! That's not good!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.290
Eeek! It's so dark!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:34.750
Here's my chance!

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:35.580
It's okay! Let me hold you!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.750
Huh? Where are you?
It's okay! Let me hold you!<b></b>

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:37.540
Huh? Where are you?
I shall stay by your side!<b></b>

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.000
I shall stay by your side!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.420
C'mon! This way!

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.130
I'm so scared!

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:42.420
Come! Follow me!

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:44.000
I can't see anything!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.710
Darliiiiing!

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:50.210
Boy, what a disaster!

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:54.380
We lost track of the others and
ended up all by ourselves in the dark!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:56.670
Well that doesn't bother me one bit.

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:00.580
What's the matter, darling?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.750
If you're scared of being in the dark,
then I'll keep you safe!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:08.670
Ugh, Moroboshiiiiii...!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:13.790
I've been looking for you! Moroboshi!

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:17.000
I'm still scared! Save me, Mendo!

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.880
This ain't how it was supposed to go!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:23.880
You fool. How on earth did you
manage to screw that up?

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:26.750
It should be obvious who's who,
even in the dark!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.710
Whatever! Don't act like you didn't
make the same mistake, dingbat!

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:32.580
I sure hope the flashlight goes out again!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:35.670
I'll win my way to Mendo's heart in no time!

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:38.580
I'm not losing track of darling,
no matter what.

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.790
