00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.380
Quick, this way!

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.290
No, this way!

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:51.250
Over here!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.710
I'm so confused!

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.460
All right. No mistakes this time.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:04.670
