alone in the dark with,

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:09.750
why'd it have to be friggin' Mendo!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.330
Miss Lum!

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.580
Shinobu!

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:19.000
