00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.420
We seriously got split up...

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:26.080
What's up? You're trembling.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.210
Moroboshi! The truth is...

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:32.790
I... I've got a serious case of both
nyctophobia and claustrophobia!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.710
Get off, dude!
You're grossing me out!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.380
Good grief.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.080
How'd you even work up the courage
to come in here in the first place?

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:43.880
Here's the thing. I can manage fine,
but only when ladies have their eyes on me.

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.130
B-but now...

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:49.130
I'm alone with your barf bag of a face,
which has made my fear run out of control.

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:52.960
WAHHHHH! I'M SCARED!
SO SCAAAAAARED!

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:55.790
Keep this up and I swear I'm gonna leave
your sorry butt alone in this cave, dammit!

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.670
Darliiiiing!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:59.710
Mendo! Where are you?!

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:00.580
<b>WHAM</b>

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.460
There you are, darling!

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:02.880
Oh Mendo!

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:05.210
Are you all right, ladies?

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:07.460
Eek! It was so spooky!

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:08.670
You're okay now.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:12.040
Darling? Why does it look like
you're making out with the wall?

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.210
Come now, no more tears.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:18.710
There's nothing for you
to be afraid of anymore.

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:20.420
Go on. Give me a smile.

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:22.670
Poof.

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:26.000
WAHHHHH! IT'S DARK!
IT'S CRAMPED! I'M SCARED!

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:26.670
Poof.
Click.<b></b>

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:27.290
Poof.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.790
AHHHHH! IT'S DARK!

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:29.500
Poof.
Click.<b></b>

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.170
Poof.

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:31.540
IT'S CRAMPED! I'M SCARED!

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.210
Poof.
Click.<b></b>

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:32.630
Poof.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:33.330
WAH!

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:34.000
Poof.
Click.<b></b>

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.540
Okay, it's time go back.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.080
What the heck! Why'd you go
