00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:40.250
I thought I heard somebody wailing...

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:41.670
Cripes, it's like his pride gave him superpowers.

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:43.540
Let's find the exit.
Cripes, it's like his pride gave him superpowers.<b></b>

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.000
Now, which way did we come from?

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.830
I don't remember.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:56.000
What?! Don't tell me we're lost!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.830
Eek! I'm scared!

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.710
Give it a rest already, Mendo!

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:03.420
It's not me. The batteries are
really dead this time.

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:04.790
AW CRUD!

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.750
Oh please, no!
What are we gonna do?!

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.170
Darling, where are you?!

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:09.460
