00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.380
ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP!
Time to shed some light on things!<b></b>

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.670
<b>ZAP</b>

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.670
<b>ZAP</b>

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.250
ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP ZAP!

